        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four players enter a cursed place. Only those who solve its riddles will escape alive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Red Riddles</i>, you and up to three friends step into haunted locations where every corner whispers danger. Blood-written riddles taunt you, monsters prowl the halls, and the clock ticks down toward your final breath. Survive long enough to uncover the demon’s name, rescue teammates buried alive, and race back to the car before the curse claims you all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each session is unpredictable: riddles shift, scares strike at random, and monsters adapt to your fear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔹 Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Horror Survival</strong> – Play solo or with up to 3 friends in tense, first-person horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve Twisted Riddles</strong> – Decipher blood-smeared puzzles that reveal the demon’s identity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buried Alive</strong> – When monsters catch you, you’re dragged into a grave. Teammates must dig you out before it’s too late.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relentless Monsters</strong> – Ghosts, demons, and worse stalk you based on sound, movement, and mistakes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Scares</strong> – Randomized riddles, monster behavior, and jump scares keep each run fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Haunted Map </strong>– Explore eerie houses, a graveyard, and cursed grounds filled with hidden clues.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four players enter a cursed place. Only those who solve its riddles will escape alive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Red Riddles</i>, you and up to three friends step into haunted locations where every corner whispers danger. Blood-written riddles taunt you, monsters prowl the halls, and the clock ticks down toward your final breath. Survive long enough to uncover the demon’s name, rescue teammates buried alive, and race back to the car before the curse claims you all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each session is unpredictable: riddles shift, scares strike at random, and monsters adapt to your fear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔹 Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Horror Survival</strong> – Play solo or with up to 3 friends in tense, first-person horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve Twisted Riddles</strong> – Decipher blood-smeared puzzles that reveal the demon’s identity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buried Alive</strong> – When monsters catch you, you’re dragged into a grave. Teammates must dig you out before it’s too late.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relentless Monsters</strong> – Ghosts, demons, and worse stalk you based on sound, movement, and mistakes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Scares</strong> – Randomized riddles, monster behavior, and jump scares keep each run fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Haunted Map </strong>– Explore eerie houses, a graveyard, and cursed grounds filled with hidden clues.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Red Riddles is a first-person co-op horror puzzle game for 1–4 players. Search haunted locations, read and solve riddles written on walls, dig up and rescue buried teammates, and avoid monsters that hunt you.",
